    the top card of your Deck, and if it is a Trap Card, add it to your hand. Otherwise,
    send it to the Graveyard. Once per turn, during either player''s turn, if this
    card has a Trap Card as Xyz Material: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this
    card, then target 1 card on the field; destroy it.'
